card.statement:
\parbox[c]{0.8\textwidth}{the problem of classifying
three-dimensional arrays up to
equivalence transformations

\[
[a_{ijk}]_{i=1}^{m}\,{}_{j=1}^{n}\,{}_{k=1}^{t}\ \mapsto\ \Bigl[
\sum_{i,j,k}
a_{ijk}u_{ii'}
v_{jj'}w_{kk'}\Bigr]{}_{i'=1}^{m}\,{}_{j'=1}^{n}\,{}_{k'=1}^{t}
\]

in which $[u_{ii'}]$, $[v_{jj'}]$, $[w_{kk'}]$ are nonsingular matrices}
